    "updatedAt": "2026-06-30T11:44:56.150698+00:00"
  },
  {
    "memoryId": "learn_consolidation_20260630_comic-character-artist_sem_02",
    "employeeKey": "comic-character-artist",
    "content": "R1艾拉(EP03起)：成年年轻女性/修长/黑长发银蓝高光/蓝瞳/偏白肤/黑蓝露肩星环法师战斗装/透明纱质外摆/大腿绑带/膝上长靴/暗金属法杖。",
    "category": "character",
    "importance": 0.97,
    "sourceSession": "learn_consolidation_20260630",
