  },
  {
    "memoryId": "pro_craft_deep_20260630_comic-character-artist_ai_consistency_01",
    "employeeKey": "comic-character-artist",
    "content": "AI角色漂移的根因：每个clip独立生成、对同样描述每次解读不同，几十个clip累积成穿帮——这是AI视频最核心生产难题。（来源:AI Magicx一致性指南）",
    "category": "craft",
    "importance": 0.9,
    "sourceSession": "pro_craft_deep_20260630",
    "accessCount": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-06-30T12:34:27.366500+00:00",
    "lastAccessed": null,
    "updatedAt": "2026-06-30T12:34:27.366500+00:00"
  },
  {
    "memoryId": "pro_craft_deep_20260630_comic-character-artist_ai_consistency_02",
    "employeeKey": "comic-character-artist",
    "content": "保一致性的硬解法：先备3-5张参考图(正面+3/4侧+全身服装+道具单独)做成转面母版，提示词只写动作和环境、不再重抄角色外貌——参考图负责长相。（来源:neolemon/Artlist一致性工作流）",
    "category": "craft",
    "importance": 0.9,
    "sourceSession": "pro_craft_deep_20260630",
    "accessCount": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-06-30T12:34:27.366500+00:00",
    "lastAccessed": null,
    "updatedAt": "2026-06-30T12:34:27.366500+00:00"
  },
  {
    "memoryId": "pro_craft_deep_20260630_comic-character-artist_ai_consistency_03",
    "employeeKey": "comic-character-artist",
    "content": "锁首帧+尾帧(first/end frame)控制运动起止，配合锁定风格和稳定布光，是跨镜一致性的关键操作。（来源:Kittl AI视频一致性）",
    "category": "craft",
    "importance": 0.9,
    "sourceSession": "pro_craft_deep_20260630",
    "accessCount": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-06-30T12:34:27.366500+00:00",
    "lastAccessed": null,
    "updatedAt": "2026-06-30T12:34:27.366500+00:00"
  },
  {
    "memoryId": "pro_craft_deep2_20260630_comic-character-artist_costume_02",
    "employeeKey": "comic-character-artist",
    "content": "剪影渐变追踪弧光：弱角色起始圆肩塌肩、得权后变挺括方肩。三阶段造型=初始look/冲突look(破损错搭)/结局look(进化剪影)。苍霖早中后期服装正是此法。（来源:Studiovity/AMPAS服装叙事）",
    "category": "craft",
    "importance": 0.55,
    "sourceSession": "pro_craft_deep2_20260630",
    "accessCount": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-06-30T12:40:38.660400+00:00",
    "lastAccessed": null,
    "updatedAt": "2026-06-30T12:40:38.660400+00:00"
  },
  {
    "memoryId": "pro_craft_deep_20260630_comic-character-artist_shape_language_01",
    "employeeKey": "comic-character-artist",
    "content": "形状语言：圆=友善柔软安全，方=稳定可靠/英雄导师，三角=动感攻击/反派。角色的主导形状一眼传达性格。（来源:CharacterBazaar形状理论）",
    "category": "craft",
    "importance": 0.55,
    "sourceSession": "pro_craft_deep_20260630",
    "accessCount": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-06-30T12:34:27.366500+00:00",
    "lastAccessed": null,
    "updatedAt": "2026-06-30T12:34:27.366500+00:00"
  },
  {
    "memoryId": "pro_craft_deep_20260630_comic-character-artist_shape_language_02",
    "employeeKey": "comic-character-artist",
    "content": "剪影测试是角色设计的行业验收法：只给剪影别人能猜对身份性格才算成立。形状决定剪影、比例、服装、五官。（来源:vsquad形状语言）",
    "category": "craft",
    "importance": 0.55,
    "sourceSession": "pro_craft_deep_20260630",
    "accessCount": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-06-30T12:34:27.366500+00:00",
    "lastAccessed": null,
    "updatedAt": "2026-06-30T12:34:27.366500+00:00"
  },
  {
    "memoryId": "pro_craft_deep2_20260630_comic-character-artist_costume_01",
    "employeeKey": "comic-character-artist",
    "content": "服装是角色开口前的名片：颜色/面料/破损/合身在第一眼就传达身份与处境，颜色常先于台词泄露情绪。（来源:Studiovity服装设计）",
    "category": "craft",
    "importance": 0.55,
    "sourceSession": "pro_craft_deep2_20260630",
    "accessCount": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-06-30T12:40:38.660400+00:00",
    "lastAccessed": null,
    "updatedAt": "2026-06-30T12:40:38.660400+00:00"
  },
  {
    "memoryId": "pro_craft_deep2_20260630_comic-character-artist_expression_01",
    "employeeKey": "comic-character-artist",
    "content": "眉/眼/嘴三大件承担最大情绪表达，画表情先定这三个再加细节(抬降眉/改眼睑/调嘴角)。（来源:AnimeOutline表情教程）",
    "category": "craft",
    "importance": 0.55,
    "sourceSession": "pro_craft_deep2_20260630",
    "accessCount": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-06-30T12:40:38.660400+00:00",
    "lastAccessed": null,
    "updatedAt": "2026-06-30T12:40:38.660400+00:00"
  },
  {
    "memoryId": "pro_craft_deep2_20260630_comic-character-artist_expression_02",
    "employeeKey": "comic-character-artist",
    "content": "六大普世情绪有固定特征组合：怒=眉锁下压+抿唇，惧=睁眼扬眉微张嘴，惊=扬眉瞪眼张嘴。表情必须一眼可读(一张画只显示1/12秒)。（来源:Clip Studio表情）",
    "category": "craft",
    "importance": 0.55,
    "sourceSession": "pro_craft_deep2_20260630",
    "accessCount": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-06-30T12:40:38.660400+00:00",
    "lastAccessed": null,
    "updatedAt": "2026-06-30T12:40:38.660400+00:00"
  },
  {
    "memoryId": "pro_craft_deep2_20260630_comic-character-artist_anatomy_01",
    "employeeKey": "comic-character-artist",
    "content": "成人约7.5-8头高(女7.5)，肩宽男2-2.5头/女2头；自然下垂时肘对腰、腕对裆——画人先用头作单位量这几个对位点。（来源:TheDrawingSource人体比例）",
    "category": "craft",
    "importance": 0.55,
    "sourceSession": "pro_craft_deep2_20260630",
    "accessCount": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-06-30T12:40:38.660400+00:00",
    "lastAccessed": null,
    "updatedAt": "2026-06-30T12:40:38.660400+00:00"
  },
  {
