  {
    "memoryId": "pro_canon_wiki_20260630_comic-character-artist_color_01",
    "employeeKey": "comic-character-artist",
    "content": "色彩三属性=色相/明度/饱和度；改一个不动其它，是控制画面的基本维度。（来源:维基百科·色彩理論）",
    "category": "knowledge",
    "importance": 0.55,
    "sourceSession": "pro_canon_wiki_20260630",
