  },
  {
    "memoryId": "pro_canon_wiki_20260630_comic-character-artist_color_02",
    "employeeKey": "comic-character-artist",
    "content": "互补色（色轮相对）制造最大对比张力，类似色（色轮相邻）自然和谐——冲突场景用互补，统一氛围用类似。（来源:维基百科·色彩理論）",
    "category": "knowledge",
    "importance": 0.55,
    "sourceSession": "pro_canon_wiki_20260630",
    "accessCount": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-06-30T12:28:25.765700+00:00",
    "lastAccessed": null,
    "updatedAt": "2026-06-30T12:28:25.765700+00:00"
  },
  {
    "memoryId": "pro_canon_wiki_20260630_comic-character-artist_color_03",
    "employeeKey": "comic-character-artist",
    "content": "暖色/冷色各自触发不同心理联想，配色是情绪工具不只是好看。（来源:维基百科·色彩理論）",
